returns.description:
Form data in requested format with token counts:
- summary: {title, question_count, questions: [{title, type, options, required}], tokens: ~1.5K}
- text: {text_content: string, question_count, tokens: ~15K}
- markdown: {markdown_content: string, question_count, tokens: ~18K}
- full: {complete JSON structure, tokens: 95K}

Response data in requested format with token counts:
- summary: {total_responses, aggregated_answers: [{question, answer_counts, percentages}], tokens: ~3K}
- sample: {responses: [{response_id, timestamp, answers}], total_responses, showing_count, tokens: ~5K}
- full: {all responses with complete metadata, tokens: 500K+}
